OpenBSD FVWM 2.2.5: Library Rewrite
====================================

Changes to the shared library (libfvwm):

  DELETED: safemalloc.c     Replaced by xalloc.h inline functions
  fvwmlib.h:                Removed GCC __attribute__ compat guards,
                            removed stale xmalloc extern declaration
  debug.c:                  Removed vfprintf/_doprnt fallback
  System.c:                 Removed sysconf/getdtablesize and HAVE_UNAME
                            branching; uses sysconf(3)/uname(3) directly
  Module.c:                 Fixed body_length integer underflow (HIGH)
  ModParse.c:               Removed incorrect comment

Apply with:  patch -p0 < 0002-libs-rewrite.patch
From the CVS repository root directory containing fvwm/

NOT VERIFIED: No compilation or runtime testing performed.

